    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/5-the-avenue-orlynn-park-lusk-dublin-k45-a436\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 5 The Avenue, Lusk in Dublin.\r\n\r\nWelcome to this charming semi-detached residence, nestled in the peaceful setting of Orlynn Park, Lusk, Dublin K45 A436. The property's exterior boasts a classic architectural style, complete with a well-maintained front garden and a driveway providing off-street parking.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the home, you are greeted by a spacious and inviting hallway leading to the main living areas. The ground floor features a bright living room, offering a warm and welcoming atmosphere for relaxation or family time. The kitchen is modern and functional, featuring ample cabinetry, generous counter space, and excellent room for everyday dining and entertaining.\r\n\r\nTo the rear of the ground floor, the property benefits from a dedicated study, ideal for remote working, homework, or use as a quiet reading space. A playroom also adds further flexibility, making the layout especially practical for families. In addition, the property includes a larger separate playroom to the rear, offering valuable extra space that could suit a variety of uses, from a children’s activity room to a hobby space or home office.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms. The main bedroom offers excellent space and a comfortable retreat, while the second bedroom is similarly well sized, making it suitable for family members or guests. The third bedroom could function as a child’s room, office, or nursery, offering flexibility in usage. A family bathroom serves the upper level, while landing storage adds further practicality.\r\n\r\nLocated in Lusk, this home is strategically positioned near local schools, sports clubs, and everyday conveniences, making it an attractive option for families. Public transport options, including bus stops, are within a short walking distance, offering easy connectivity to Dublin city centre.\r\n\r\nThis property is ideal for first-time buyers, those seeking to trade up to a larger home, or investors looking for a solid opportunity in a growing community. Its combination of practical features, flexible living spaces, modern interior, and convenient location offers a balanced and comfortable lifestyle."
      },
